creatures:
- name: Earth Elemental
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 17  
      **Hit Points** 147 (rollable(dice=14d10 + 70,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Burrow 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Initiative) (9)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=5)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-3,label=-3,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=5)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-3,label=-3,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Damage Vulnerabilities** thunder  
      **Damage Immunities** poison  
      **Condition Immunities** exhaustion, paralyzed, petrified, poisoned, unconscious  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., tremorsense 60 ft., Passive Perception 10  
      **Languages** Primordial (Terran)  
      **Challenge** 5 (1,800 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Traits

      ***Earth Glide.*** The elemental can burrow through nonmagical, unworked earth and stone. While doing so, the elemental doesn't disturb the material it moves through.

      ***Siege Monster.*** The elemental deals double damage to objects and structures.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The elemental makes two attacks, using Slam or Rock Launch in any combination.

      ***Slam.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=To Hit [Slam]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+5,dicelabel=Damage [Slam]) Bludgeoning damage.

      ***Rock Launch.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=To Hit [Rock Launch]), range 60 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+5,dicelabel=Damage [Rock Launch]) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the ***Prone*** condition.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Large Elemental, Neutral*  
    **Challenge** 5
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024earthelemental
  status: 1

